  <h1 class="article-title">2025/26 Kits Retained for Upcoming 2026/27 Season</h1>

  <p class="article-meta">
    📅 23 April 2026 | Club News
  </p>

  <img src="../images/25-26-27-homekit.png" alt="Whistle FC Home Kit" class="article-image">

  <div class="article-body">

    <p>
      Whistle Football Club are pleased to confirm that our current 2025/26 kits will be retained for the forthcoming 2026/27 season.
    </p>

    <p>
      Following an incredibly successful campaign both on and off the pitch, the club has taken the decision to roll over all three kits into the new season, allowing supporters to continue wearing the same designs that have become closely associated with recent progress.
    </p>

    <img src="../images/25-26-27-awaykit.png.png" alt="Whistle FC Away Kit" class="article-image">

    <p>
      Demand for all kits across the past season has been exceptionally strong, with record-breaking sales reflecting the growing connection between the team and supporters.
    </p>

    <p>
      As part of this decision, the club aims to improve availability, maintain consistency, and give fans the opportunity to use their shirts for longer without the need for annual changes.
    </p>

    <img src="../images/25-26-27-thirdkit.png" alt="Whistle FC Third Kit" class="article-image">

    <p>
      Updated stock of all kits will be made available via the club shop and online store ahead of the new campaign.
    </p>

    <p>
     We thank supporters for their incredible backing this season and look forward to seeing the stands filled with our colours for our final home game of 2025/26 on Saturday.
    </p>

 <p>
      <strong>One. Last. Push.</strong>
    </p>

